=== ROOT CAUSE ===
setuptools>=81 removed the vendored pkg_resources module. uv venv
installed setuptools 84.0.0 (latest) as part of --seed, which has no
pkg_resources, breaking stark_qa -> PyTDC's 'import pkg_resources'
(tdc/metadata.py:5). torch itself requires setuptools>=77.0.3, so the
fix must satisfy both floors: pin setuptools==77.0.3 (last release
with pkg_resources AND >=77.0.3).

$ tools/stark-eval/.venv/bin/pip install "setuptools==77.0.3"
Requirement already satisfied: setuptools==77.0.3 in ./tools/stark-eval/.venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages (77.0.3)

